Enhancement: More flexible formats for backup and rewrite time related options

Restic backup --time allowed in the past only the format "2006-01-02 15:04:05".

``backup --time`` and ``rewrite --new-time`` can now use the full range of
time formats as defined in internal/ui/format.go.

